[
  {
    "id": "json-format",
    "zhName": "JSON 格式化",
    "enName": "JSON Formatter",
    "zhDesc": "格式化、压缩、校验 JSON，支持语法错误定位。数据不上传。",
    "enDesc": "Format, minify and validate JSON with error positions. Runs entirely in your browser.",
    "icon": "🧩",
    "keywords": [
      "json 格式化",
      "json 校验",
      "json 压缩",
      "json formatter"
    ],
    "html": "<div class=\"app-row\">\n  <label for=\"jf-indent\">缩进</label>\n  <select id=\"jf-indent\"><option value=\"2\">2 空格</option><option value=\"4\">4 空格</option><option value=\"tab\">Tab</option></select>\n  <button class=\"app-btn\" data-act=\"format\">格式化</button>\n  <button class=\"app-btn\" data-act=\"minify\">压缩</button>\n  <button class=\"app-btn\" data-act=\"validate\">校验</button>\n  <button class=\"app-btn ghost\" data-act=\"clear\">清空</button>\n</div>\n<textarea id=\"jf-in\" class=\"app-area\" rows=\"10\" placeholder='粘贴 JSON，例如 {\"a\":1,\"b\":[2,3]}'></textarea>\n<div id=\"jf-msg\" class=\"app-msg\"></div>\n<textarea id=\"jf-out\" class=\"app-area\" rows=\"10\" readonly placeholder=\"结果会出现在这里\"></textarea>\n<div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"app-btn\" data-copy=\"jf-out\">复制结果</button></div>",
    "body": "粘贴 JSON 就能立即格式化。出错时会给出具体的位置和原因，比在编辑器里翻找快得多。所有解析都在浏览器里完成，不会上传任何内容。"
  },
  {
    "id": "base64",
    "zhName": "Base64 编解码",
    "enName": "Base64 Encoder / Decoder",
    "zhDesc": "文本与 Base64 互转，正确处理中文和 Emoji。",
    "enDesc": "Convert text to and from Base64, with proper UTF-8 handling for CJK and emoji.",
    "icon": "🔐",
    "keywords": [
      "base64 编码",
      "base64 解码",
      "base64 转换"
    ],
    "html": "<div class=\"app-row\">\n  <button class=\"app-btn\" data-act=\"encode\">编码 → Base64</button>\n  <button class=\"app-btn\" data-act=\"decode\">解码 → 文本</button>\n  <button class=\"app-btn ghost\" data-act=\"swap\">⇅ 互换</button>\n</div>\n<textarea id=\"b64-in\" class=\"app-area\" rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"输入要编码的文本，或要解码的 Base64\"></textarea>\n<div id=\"b64-msg\" class=\"app-msg\"></div>\n<textarea id=\"b64-out\" class=\"app-area\" rows=\"8\" readonly placeholder=\"结果\"></textarea>\n<div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"app-btn\" data-copy=\"b64-out\">复制结果</button></div>",
    "body": "浏览器原生的 btoa 处理中文会报错，这里用 TextEncoder 做了正确的 UTF-8 转换，中文、Emoji、生僻字都能正常往返。"
  },
  {
