    "zhDesc": "计算 SHA-1 / SHA-256 / SHA-384 / SHA-512 哈希值。",
    "enDesc": "Compute SHA-1, SHA-256, SHA-384 and SHA-512 hashes locally.",
    "icon": "🔑",
    "keywords": [
      "sha256 在线",
      "哈希计算",
      "md5 sha1 sha256"
