  {
    "id": "password",
    "zhName": "随机密码生成",
    "enName": "Password Generator",
    "zhDesc": "用系统级随机源生成强密码，可批量。",
    "enDesc": "Generate strong passwords using the system CSPRNG. Batch mode included.",
    "icon": "🔒",
    "keywords": [
      "密码生成器",
      "随机密码",
      "强密码"
    ],
    "html": "<div class=\"app-row\">\n  <label>长度 <input type=\"range\" id=\"pw-len\" min=\"6\" max=\"64\" value=\"20\"><span id=\"pw-lenv\">20</span></label>\n  <label>数量 <input type=\"number\" id=\"pw-count\" value=\"5\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" style=\"width:4em\"></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"app-row\">\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pw-up\" checked> 大写</label>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pw-low\" checked> 小写</label>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pw-num\" checked> 数字</label>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pw-sym\" checked> 符号</label>\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pw-amb\"> 排除易混字符 0O1lI</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"app-row\"><button class=\"app-btn\" data-act=\"gen\">生成</button><button class=\"app-btn ghost\" data-copy=\"pw-out\">复制全部</button></div>\n<div id=\"pw-out\" class=\"app-list mono\"></div>",
    "body": "用 crypto.getRandomValues 而不是 Math.random——后者可预测，不适合生成密码。每个字符独立随机抽取，不做「必须包含各类字符」的强行拼接。"
  },
  {
    "id": "url-encode",
    "zhName": "URL 编解码",
    "enName": "URL Encoder / Decoder",
